	(property "Description" "Hot-bar/hand-solder lands for the HS20HS072RX 2.0in LCD FPC tail (Hansheng drawing p.10: 12 fingers P0.5, exposed 3.5 mm, tail 6.5 mm wide, 5 mm stiffener on the back). Contacts are on the panel front side, so the tail must be folded 180 deg under the panel (contacts down); viewed from PCB top with the panel-exit edge at +Y, pin 1 is at -X. Lands are 0.3 mm wide and run 1.25 mm past the tail end (-Y) so an iron/hot-bar can reach the joint; F.Fab shows tail and stiffener outline for alignment."
		(at 0 0 0)
		(layer "F.Fab")
